#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:45
#: 0cf11b58cb334d6a804578b8227da7b0 39b5e92db8704c81a2ba1fe583eeea8d
#: 4ce1445557b64021a2e354f836a349c0 4eca55a272944c8baa6efa99c7c9ad56
#: 588737b14edd4954ac4a41107f39c56c 6b4badc38c3041d9a1bc6a5552ef9d8a
#: cdd06ebaeb584d188f1b6ddf8d49dab2
msgid ""
"Prior to ``Stable`` releases, a ``Beta`` version or versions get released. "
"These may be used if you wish to try newer features or help the developers "
"further flight test the code. Since they are \"beta\" versions, there "
"possibly still may be bugs (although this is possible even in Stable "
"firmware). However, it has been tested by the development team, and already "
"flight tested. This release allows a wider user base to final test the "
"firmware before its release as ``Stable``. Experienced ArduPilot users are "
"encouraged to test fly this firmware and provide feedback."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Stable`` 发布之前，会先发布一个或多个 ``Beta`` "
"版本。如果您希望尝试新功能或帮助开发者进一步飞行测试代码，可以使用这些版本。由于是「测试版」，可能仍有缺陷（尽管 Stable "
"固件中也可能存在）。但该版本已经过开发团队测试并已飞行验证。此版本允许更广泛的用户群体对固件进行最终测试后再作为 ``Stable`` "
"发布。鼓励有经验的 ArduPilot 用户试飞该固件并提供反馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:48
#: 3d12dcc6b56c4ae1b4e49af1942af734 407774073c7843cdb8744c6e5b92a943
#: 66bfd821aaf14891a77af0725a170062 73ea23610e5f44f7bd0bb13507aac79c
#: b4613b70a2874ffea6bd1c7575d5bbf8 df30e6ae237041bcb2259a78830ff018
#: ef34277b24f744f39a8bce5198549c1c
msgid "Latest Developer Version"
msgstr "最新开发者版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:50
#: 3dd75de811ae44af88c53f8e9972a2d8 4da1f03efee34de68249de355dc8b470
#: 5c21695bde5a4fcf82fbe63fc127976d 63a2cfa2fde24363883b26c2e22d8274
#: 7bf9bbcd16404aeda92f57744900dbf6 93cf7d5fac8149d89df7c9d9573a12f7
#: f2e75678e0ca4faeaf787ce320d471c5
msgid ""
"This reflects the current state of the development branch of the ArduPilot "
"code. It has been reviewed by the development team, passed all automated "
"test suites,  and in most cases, if significant changes have been made, test"
" flown. This code gets built daily and is available for testing by "
"experienced users. This corresponds to an \"alpha\" release, and may have "
"bugs, although very rarely \"crash inducing\". Very shortly after an "
"addition that changes or introduces a feature is added, the :ref:`Upcoming "
"Features <common-master-features>` section of the Wiki is updated with "
"information about the addition or change."
msgstr ""
"这反映了 ArduPilot "
"代码开发分支的当前状态。已经过开发团队审查，通过了所有自动化测试套件，并且在大多数情况下，如果做出了重大更改，也已进行飞行测试。该代码每日构建，供有经验的用户测试。这相当于"
" 「alpha」 发布，可能存在缺陷，但很少会 「导致坠机」。在添加新功能或更改功能后不久，Wiki 的 :ref:`即将推出的功能 <common-"
"master-features>` 部分会更新相关信息。"

