#: e04971ad93c44feb8e65f36c7199468f
msgid ""
"Download https://github.com/spracing/ssbl/releases and install SSBL to "
"external flash following https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#installation-to-"
"external-flash"
msgstr ""
"下载 https://github.com/spracing/ssbl/releases 并按照 "
