"下载最新的 ArduPilot 外部闪存二进制文件，例如 "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/SPRacingH7/arducopter.bin"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:151
#: 0bbc76f6b7a04461b306343e33189b6b 24714a871dc84ac5ace466f9e5e7bb95
