#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:158
#: 2b3606ebf07d47a09a163d2ea3c594d8 4d12c4a77c5a421f9dbdb1c2f1911871
#: 5ac6744c42cc4ece8bc2193bc20c9257 79757b5689674e37a5257f67e5a6e0cd
#: 7c99098786f0485e8bed50f41e019620 96a046e40d9e433ebfd1633950fd3733
#: b42beb1ed85649bca05f6436278b8a83
msgid ""
"Put the board into SSBL dfu mode - power off, hold BIND (not BOOT), power on"
" - LED flashes fast, release BIND, LED flashed slow - DFU mode enabled"
msgstr ""
"将飞控板置于 SSBL dfu 模式——断电，按住 BIND（不是 BOOT），上电——LED 快速闪烁，释放 BIND，LED 慢速闪烁——DFU "
"模式已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:159
#: 2f698e34cfb7422ca8fb4e3d0c00e854 3d5c3f7d00ef43e68146119bf129f183
