#: ce5eff541b9545929d52ed8168346a6f
msgid "Flash the binary using"
msgstr "使用以下命令烧录二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:165
#: 40fb3ba53312445389e567c636719814 41c288056baa4cf48b64d1774e930a13
#: 5c1f30c225c04436a2a212f0aa0d279a 6d8a56e7d2514297981bc4102dd5b64a
#: a520fd739a0b4b6c9a0ab333a283d35d bed4838acce6444fad36eded1d09e88f
#: f8d678a819b94202b28d5531f32248d9
msgid ""
"Verify the flash. The dfu-util command below copies the contents of the "
"flash back to the computer, the diff command will tell you if the contents "
"are identical or different. Do not attempt to fly if diff doesn't say the "
"files are identical - retry."
msgstr ""
"验证烧录结果。下面的 dfu-util 命令将闪存内容复制回电脑，diff 命令会告知内容是否相同。如果 diff "
"不显示文件相同，请勿尝试飞行——重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:172
#: 5365cb00bc2e44ceafde97fbf81625b7 745163d0c420472e8baebfdf61be33d5
#: 8f5f68ed7e484e2d984b16d956bfd941 93cc776cc6404f028187db88ead87167
#: af2acdadd72347ebac9183a6d062fde8 c3b5c27ce92e43b0acef858495ce6ff2
#: c40d997bb35845fe8a5bc7d7b291087c
msgid ""
"Power off, install an SD card (.note: you *must* install an SD card, the "
"firmware will not boot without it), power on"
msgstr "断电，安装 SD 卡（注意：*必须*安装 SD 卡，否则固件无法启动），上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:173
#: 32da6747aa374c51836f6ad4df7d09b2 4517eebf135e4b0887e1d7f6efc76d45
#: 5d6fd7a5671a4d588403b7019b366540 708877e521a4407bb2bf40541377e547
#: 8a4045788a6e44daa64cba6292f89af7 a168b4a8058b480a91b2e71d7d5bbc18
#: bf8c60430c1949ff9dfc69c81dc3fd00
msgid "Configure the board as normal using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 按正常方式配置飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:175
#: 3c9da5341f494d6f9774b375d51f461d 6a3006535cf84e68a33b165a8b916a5c
#: 8b0e5b66723547e2969867c1d9a4b501 8fe1090c13274e6ab64dec856c90625d
#: 97a8167776e84da19c28ed46894a3315 afaa4705d83049fbb67a406583885ce3
#: c54b1044e27842bab962d3de880630d1
msgid ""
"At this point you should have working firmware on the board. If you want to "
"load new firmware you will need to follow steps 2-7 again (you cannot use "
"Mission Planner to load firmware). If you are certain that you will never "
"want to load betaflight on the board then you can install the ArduPilot "
"bootloader."
msgstr ""
"此时飞控板上应有可用的固件。如果要烧录新固件，需要重复步骤 2-7（不能使用 Mission Planner 烧录固件）。如果确定不再需要在飞控板上烧录"
" Betaflight，可以安装 ArduPilot 引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:178
#: 1420f0ad93254fcf88c6793a2ae9b3cd 203209fa14bc47888d24af6d3b49c6d1
#: 23a0ae26bb884be88813fa424467e760 b9eb1298593a4345965e213a71987053
#: d1db0bbfbd05486480ebac55760878b7 d4f35fd31ca041dc9d154dd438b7478e
#: fca11e4b07d448cb815ab43fe5dcd775
msgid "Installing the ArduPilot bootloader"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot 引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:180
#: 059c3fec1e224e20850662a7b8178df5 29d4a9dc95b3412c9f26adf9b3d16b30
#: 9c6033c547ad44809e43a4cc7cf67d95 b646d15c68f14bfca6f3f638ddda1e19
#: b827be7a171f418d8107bb40ed8f7e8e c0620e1bed104ce4b2e06970c409c15b
#: f7c8555fd7ff4e7c8d80a209bf6edaa7
msgid ""
"installing the ArduPilot bootloader is a one-way operation. You cannot "
"restore the board to factory configuration or load betaflight after this "
"step - you would have to return the board to Seriously Pro to be re-flashed "
"with factory firmware, assuming that is possible"
msgstr ""
"安装 ArduPilot 引导程序是不可逆操作。此步骤后无法将飞控板恢复到出厂配置或烧录 Betaflight——您必须将飞控板退回给 "
"Seriously Pro 以重新刷写出厂固件（如果可能的话）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:182
#: 08b8965c748f4ae6a4cf0af0c3ff58cc 24b4910ebad54206aca993b2ec2e60fc
#: 3eb219d9c2eb45ed9cc4bc26dead105a b7b005f1ca584aa198a620c81b24fae9
#: d45c7c50fab34ac2a1b01cac2bcd26df f251d608f6ab4231aa22a475e0ec4780
#: f92c7dbf32c047a589a3f2434fb3017b
msgid ""
"**If you are certain that you only want to use ArduPilot on the board**, "
"then flashing the ardupilot bootloader enables much simpler subsequent "
"upgrades."
msgstr "**如果确定只想在飞控板上使用 ArduPilot**，那么烧录 ArduPilot 引导程序可以使后续升级更加简单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:184
#: 191699d36a4e46739abc191d3f03ad9d 316966cf97264b51b0d3477afb202f5f
#: 4855a996781349b59f68e21b19c61a6b 5f2e63f3ef5f44659640c200d276453b
#: 9e9db66f98b440a58853002a317f9b74 c86def2469e043f69d85be8dee58b108
#: efe80512e63a4add8097d1719d5e0efb
msgid ""
"You must initially have a working version of ArduPilot installed on the "
"board - follow the steps above."
msgstr "必须先在飞控板上安装可用的 ArduPilot 版本——按上述步骤操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:185
#: 06335969f1314c36b4315272e42a6c60 1643bf5e598a4f188835dcb4c77eb1d8
#: 17c2273a8f424988b2128ba358c9ab97 39b588770806484cb57d1f3ce0fd8db5
#: cb9cecd7107b4510a0b9aa29580228c9 e49215ced3f94d80bae81aa6555bd2e6
#: f2908ad7dfac46a28ea3ea1c227c1077
msgid ""
"You now must remove the copy protection on the internal flash. This is a "
"destructive operation requiring complete erasure of the flash. ArduPilot "
"provides support to make this easy. Set :ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = "
"16."
msgstr ""
"现在必须解除内部闪存的写保护。这是一个破坏性操作，需要完全擦除闪存。ArduPilot 提供支持使此操作更简便。设置 "
":ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 16。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:186
#: 3becab43735f48eaae2f767503a5da55 56e0619a118c48c889ffd83822aafdc8
#: 8bb3504637f64673b01850069b969cc6 ba1b35bdd7a34d40a93f972a3e175848
#: dcddcd26a0274007a3d139875a828e5e de567be4a4ef4a5398a01cb875160835
#: ea35c7522d034f43a03b1f4912904911
msgid ""
"Power off and power on the board. The board will not appear to boot but the "
"flash sector is being erased. Wait a few seconds and then power off the "
"board."
msgstr "断电并重新上电。飞控板看起来不会启动，但闪存扇区正在被擦除。等待几秒钟，然后断电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:187
#: 202c459ac5194d7da05db01f017509a1 3b741649fc9349a7b71d54990c8ea496
#: 3f90f919aace42c2946e2432f2941903 4ec56364a5b04fa1994ff7c63b95bb86
#: 753f843548d748a4b453a4f82b3dac94 82fd100c56894d94aa5d3345183575e7
#: a053188e9fed4943ae93044b5a3deee8
msgid ""
"Hold down the ``boot`` button (boot *not* bind this time) and power on the "
"autopilot. This will put the board in dfu mode."
msgstr "按住 ``boot`` 按钮（这次是 boot *而非* bind），然后给飞控板上电。这将使飞控板进入 dfu 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:188
#: 06a99e6c6fd84b78956426d756b1f254 172ff60b60694063b163b4cfc2d568ad
#: 206a9414626d48028a69b5b90a2609ac 4befed7ca6104a3faba7422e70e6f6f5
#: 756e13d0dca443b2846ebaead217883f a84178ef2a934e83afbf4d1cdd10a1c8
#: d961bcdc66bf4a37b4a232a73b293db9
msgid ""
"Download the ArduPilot bootloader, e.g. "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/SPRacingH7_bl.bin"
msgstr ""
"下载 ArduPilot 引导程序，例如 "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/SPRacingH7_bl.bin"

